            "review_title": "Review at Ruou Vang Da Loc Nha Trang",
            "review_text": "Cham Khanh Hoa\nCam Ranh, Vietnam19 contributions\n0\nGood wine Fair Price and Excellent Service\nSep 2019\nI Came with my friend in the cool evening of Nha Trang city.\n\nBuy 4 bottle of different wines but all red ones. Take along a chicken; pork and beef also. Shop only sell wine but they have a big table for come and drink so we advise you should buy some thing to eat. We usually visit there to talk after long working hours. \nThe nice staff prepared the table with clean dish and glass of course...\nWe did enjoy the environment and have take some pics below.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten October 3, 2019",
